{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Population census of the Netherlands, 1795 : General population in the Batavian Republic"},{"typeName":"alternativeTitle","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Volkstellinge in de Nederlandsche Republiek, 1795 : Generaale volksmeenigte in de Bataafsche Republiek"]},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NHDA: D0112"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:38761"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek (CBS)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"NIWI - KNAW"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Data Station Admin"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>The dataset is based on the population census of the Netherlands in 1795.<br>Content: images of the publications, excel files with data entered from the published tables and a searchable pdf files of the text sections.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"historical demography"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"census"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"demographic data"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"population statistics"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tot februari 2015 waren de gescande bladen enkel als afgeleide JPEG-bestanden bij deze dataset gepubliceerd. Op 25 februari 2015 zijn de scans van de bladen in de originele hoge kwaliteit TIFF-bestanden bij de dataset geplaatst en in plaats van de lagere kwaliteit JPEG-bestanden beschikbaar gesteld.\n\nUp until February 2015, the images of the publications were only published as low-quality JPEG images. On February 25th, 2015, the original high-quality TIFF images were also added to the dataset file content and published instead of the lower quality JPEG images."},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1998-01-01"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P.K. Doorn (research initiator) (NIWI-KNAW)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P.K. Doorn (NIWI-KNAW)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-08-17"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1998-01-01"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>In 1999, to celebrate the jubilee of 100 years of the Statistics Netherlands, the publications with the results of all Dutch censuses of 1795, 1830, 1840, 1849, 1859, 1869, 1879, 1889, 1899, 1909, 1919, 1920, 1930, 1947, 1956, 1960 and 1971 have been scanned. In addition, the census data of the jubilee year 1899 have been entered in a database.<br><br>The data served for a creation of two sets of CD's published by the Statistics Netherlands:<br><br>Set 1: Data en publicatie volkstelling 1899. Two cd-rom's. ISBN 90.6861.176.3 (see http:\/\/www.aksant.nl\/boeken\/boek_464.asp).<br><br>Set 2: Publicaties volkstellingen 1795-1971. Five cd-rom's, ISBN 90.6861.177.1 (see http:\/\/www.aksant.nl\/boeken\/boek_465.asp).<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Volks-tellinge in de Nederlandsche Republiek. Uitgegeven op last der Commissie tot het ontwerpen van een plan van constitutie voor het volk van Nederland : Generaale volksmeenigte in de Bataafsche Republiek; Den Haag : 's Lands Drukkery, 1796; Libraries CBS, Voorburg and Heerlen; Mag\/III\/3\/1796,dl.1 (Voorburg) ;  H1A-B\/1796,dl.1 (Heerlen) \n \nRapport van de Commissie tot de Telling en Verdeeling van het volk van Holland; [Den Haag] : s.n., 1796; 8, LX p. (tab.); Libraries of Statistics Netherlands in Voorburg and Heerlen; 1A-B\/1795 and Mag\/III\/3\/1795 (Voorburg), H1A-B\/1795 (Heerlen)"]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Data Archiving and Networked Services (DANS)","Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek (CBS)"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["English"